      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778922881554,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* loan calculator app (without annoying ass ads) with maybe ability to scan loan estimates PDFs and\ncompare, maybe stretch goal to give some llm assessment of comparison, maybe even compare end\nfinancial states against renting with dial for length of time * report generator app which helps\ngenerate PDF \"rent rolls\" for a family scale rental property management business. each month - intake\nPDF bank statements from every property's corporation bank account, plus other sources like venmo\nand manual cash input, intake lease PDFs, and output PDF report of whether all rent from all units\nhas been collected * photo sharing app for me to share albums with family/friends/parter where i can\nupload/add to albums, and share links with family/friends/partner that have RBAC built in - only\ncertain receipients or groups of receipients can view certain photos, maybe via tags - or even just\nhelp user create separate \"virtual albums\" to share and keep things very separate",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* loan calculator app (without annoying ass ads) with maybe ability to scan loan estimates PDFs and compare, maybe stretch goal to give some llm assessment of comparison, maybe even compare end financial states against renting with dial for length of time * report generator app which helps generate PDF \"rent rolls\" for a family scale rental property management business. each month - intake PDF bank statements from every property's corporation bank account, plus other sources like venmo and manual cash input, intake lease PDFs, and output PDF report of whether all rent from all units has been collected * photo sharing app for me to share albums with family/friends/parter where i can upload/add to albums, and share links with family/friends/partner that have RBAC built in - only certain receipients or groups of receipients can view certain photos, maybe via tags - or even just help user create separate \"virtual albums\" to share and keep things very separate",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
